    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>AnnotationScopeMetadataResolver</code> using the\nsupplied default <a href=\"ScopedProxyMode.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ScopedProxyMode</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用提供的默认<a href=\"ScopedProxyMode.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ScopedProxyMode</code></a>构建一个新的<code>AnnotationScopeMetadataResolver</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations can of course use any strategy they like to\ndetermine the scope metadata, but some implementations that spring\nimmediately to mind might be to use source level annotations\npresent on <a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html#getBeanClassName()\"><code>the class</code></a> of the\nsupplied <code>definition</code>, or to use metadata present in the\n<a href=\"../../core/AttributeAccessor.html#attributeNames()\"><code>AttributeAccessor.attributeNames()</code></a> of the supplied <code>definition</code>.",
      "translation": "实现当然可以使用任何策略来确定作用域元数据，但一些 Spring 立即想到的实现可能是使用提供的`definition`的<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html#getBeanClassName()\"><code>类</code></a>上存在的源代码级别注解，或使用提供的`definition`的<a href=\"../../core/AttributeAccessor.html#attributeNames()\"><code>AttributeAccessor.attributeNames()</code></a>中存在的元数据。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The exact type of annotation that is checked for is configurable via\n<a href=\"#setScopeAnnotationType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>setScopeAnnotationType(Class)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "要检查的注解确切类型可通过 <a href=\"#setScopeAnnotationType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>setScopeAnnotationType(Class)</code></a> 进行配置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
